SUMMARY:Mystik Vibes
DESCRIPTION:Mystik Vibes is an Indo-Jazz musical journey by Amith Nadig\, Muthu Kumar\, and Aman Mahajan\, a meeting point where the melodic language of Carnatic and Hindustani music finds kinship with the freedom of Jazz. Beneath three distinct traditions\, the musicians uncover a single\, shared pulse: improvisation\, emotion\, breath. If music can dissolve the boundaries between such different worlds\, what else might dissolve\, if we listened closely enough? \nBuilt almost entirely from original compositions\, each piece carries the story of the musician who wrote it\, and the friendship between all three. Every note becomes a small act of translation\, one tradition speaking to another\, until the differences soften and only the music remains. A short Q&A follows the performance\, encouraging audiences to engage deeply with the experience. \nSupported by: \n \n\n\nMusic without Barriers\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeYmErqzJBSuUNVsQKQcB1iRT4QYZ_f_MwJX1hE5wigBIhddw/viewform?usp=publish-editor)\n*Performers*: Amith Nadig\, Muthu Kumar\, Aman Mahajan\n*Event Categories*: Music\, Performing Arts
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/mystik-vibes/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Music,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Thumbnailmv.jpg
